          "text": "That's exactly the \"hiding in plain sight\" quality of Singapore's land reclamation - once you know to look, you can't unsee it, from the skyline down to the airport runways. And that irony about the refinery's own long-term contribution to the very sea-level rise threatening the reclaimed land isn't lost on us either. Thank you for such an observant, thoughtful comment.",
